{"id": 63457, "date": "2025-12-29T04:00:48", "date_gmt": "2025-12-29T12:00:48", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=63457"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T21:33:10", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T04:33:10", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-29-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/29/kingdom-of-days-december-29-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 29"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1972: </strong><del>Rick</del> Bruce plays in Ohio for the first time, when he and the band open for Sha Na Na in Dayton.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"14917\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1972-12-29/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1972-12-29.jpg?fit=500%2C434&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"500,434\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1972-12-29\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1972-12-29.jpg?fit=500%2C434&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-14917 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1972-12-29.jpg?resize=500%2C434&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"434\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1972-12-29.jpg?w=500&amp;ssl=1 500w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1972-12-29.jpg?resize=300%2C260&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1973:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and his unnamed band play two shows on their third of four nights at The Main Point in Bryn Mawr, Pennsylvania.</p>\n<p><strong>1974:\u00a0</strong>Bruce makes a guest appearance with Southside Johnny and Steve Van Zandt&#8217;s Blackberry Booze Band at The Stone Pony in Asbury Park.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"14918\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1974-12-29/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1974-12-29.jpg?fit=468%2C365&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"468,365\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1974-12-29\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1974-12-29.jpg?fit=468%2C365&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-14918 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1974-12-29.jpg?resize=468%2C365&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"468\" height=\"365\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1974-12-29.jpg?w=468&amp;ssl=1 468w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/1974-12-29.jpg?resize=300%2C234&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 468px) 100vw, 468px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>On his night off during his three-night stand in Philadelphia, Bruce takes in the J. Geils Band show at the Spectrum from the press box (along with actress Faye Dunaway).</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23482\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-12-29/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?fit=1134%2C1400&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1134,1400\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-12-29\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?fit=758%2C936&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23482 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?resize=758%2C936&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"936\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?w=1134&amp;ssl=1 1134w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?resize=243%2C300&amp;ssl=1 243w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?resize=829%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 829w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/1975-12-29.png?resize=768%2C948&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1977:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band record for\u00a0<em>Darkness on the Edge of Town</em> at The Record Plant in New York City.</p>\n<p><strong>1980:\u00a0</strong>At Night Two of three in Uniondale on the River Tour, Bruce opens with the tour premiere of &#8220;Night.&#8221; Toward the end of the show comes another premiere: a tour one-off of &#8220;Incident on 57th Street.&#8221; That performance of &#8220;Incident&#8221; will be released as a B-side years later, and &#8220;Darkness on the Edge of Town,&#8221; &#8220;This Land is Your Land,&#8221; and &#8220;You Can Look (But You Better Not Touch)&#8221; will be officially released on\u00a0<em>Live 1975-85.\u00a0</em>This show is available as part of Bruce&#8217;s official archive series.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ZFKbVlkspY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2Cs2woIb2fY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vF50vNJ1k3Y?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hwdgPwPWeEc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NbmLwUiJ6QA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>1986:\u00a0</strong>Max, Garry, and Patti drop by the set of\u00a0<em>Good Morning, America</em> to share their thoughts about what it&#8217;s like to be in the E Street Band.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/usxiNW11S6w?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2017:\u00a0</strong>Patti Scialfa is sick with the flu, so Bruce continues playing the &#8220;B&#8221; setlist at\u00a0<em>Springsteen on Broadway\u00a0</em>at the Walter Kerr Theater in New York City.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>On this date: Bruce&#8217;s first show in Ohio, performances destined for Live 1975-85, and an E Street Band guest appearance on Good Morning America. More highlights inside.</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 14919, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_access": "", "_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content": false, "_jetpack_feature_clip_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content": false, "footnotes": "", "jetpack_publicize_message": "", "jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled": true, "jetpack_social_post_already_shared": true, "jetpack_social_options": {"image_generator_settings": {"template": "highway", "default_image_id": 0, "font": "", "enabled": false}, "version": 2}, "jetpack_post_was_ever_published": false}, "categories": [2], "tags": [1542, 1236, 299, 2006, 60, 1248, 10, 1741, 128, 2005, 273, 372, 449, 1749], "class_list": ["post-63457", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "has-post-thumbnail", "hentry", "category-kingdom-of-days", "tag-blackberry-booze-band", "tag-bryn-mawr", "tag-darkness-on-the-edge-of-town", "tag-dayton", "tag-incident-on-57th-street", "tag-live-1975-85", "tag-main-point", "tag-ohio", "tag-river-tour", "tag-sha-na-na", "tag-springsteen-on-broadway", "tag-this-land-is-your-land", "tag-uniondale", "tag-you-can-look-but-you-better-not-touch"], "aioseo_notices": [], "aioseo_head": "\n\t\t<!-- All in One SEO 5.0.0.1 - aioseo.com -->\n\t<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"max-image-preview:large\" />\n\t<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Ken\"/>\n\t<link rel=\"can